{% endfor %}

Write a wiki page with:
- A clear first paragraph defining the concept
- Key aspects, properties, or characteristics
- Relevant relationships to other concepts (use [[wikilinks]] where applicable)

Synthesize primarily from the source summaries when available; use the concise definitions to keep the meaning precise. Do not invent facts beyond the provided material. Output only the Markdown content — no preamble, no code fences.
